{"id":"n40430-1-7","stage":5,"title":"느슨하다 · 松","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40430-1-7-1","ko":"이거 매듭이 느슨해서 나중에 풀릴 것 같아.","zh":"这个结有点松，好像以后会散开的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매듭이","meaning":"结，扣儿","explanation":"매듭：结，扣儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"매듭","audio":"/audio/06cb627a609948be4489.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55563","senseId":"1","lemma":"매듭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느슨해서","meaning":"松，不紧","explanation":"느슨하다：松，不紧；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"느슨하다","audio":"/audio/cc2f3f3781a1b407a05c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40430","senseId":"1","lemma":"느슨하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나중에","meaning":"后来，以后","explanation":"나중：后来，以后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"1","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀릴","meaning":"被解开，解","explanation":"풀리다：被解开，解；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"풀리다","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62314","senseId":"1","lemma":"풀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"06cb627a609948be","term":"매듭","zh":"结，扣儿","audio":"/audio/06cb627a609948be4489.mp3","entryId":"55563","definition":"将绳或线打结而成的疙瘩。","pronunciation":["매듭"]},{"id":"cc2f3f3781a1b407","term":"느슨하다","zh":"松，不紧","audio":"/audio/cc2f3f3781a1b407a05c.mp3","entryId":"40430","definition":"打结或捆起来的绳、结等稍微解，有些松动。","pronunciation":["느슨하다"]},{"id":"b8922cba892bea4a","term":"나중","zh":"后来，以后","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3","entryId":"62275","definition":"一定的时间过后。","pronunciation":["나ː중"]},{"id":"aba31e511b1563e0","term":"풀리다","zh":"被解开，解","audio":"/audio/aba31e511b1563e0e599.mp3","entryId":"62314","definition":"被捆绑或缠绕的东西变回原来的状态。","pronunciation":["풀리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a828dc68426af01d6faf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40430-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 조금 더 꽉 묶을까?","zh":"那要再绑紧一点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽉","meaning":"紧紧，用力","explanation":"꽉：紧紧，用力","readings":[{"term":"꽉","audio":"/audio/991291daac49a3be8f11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14647","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"묶을까?","meaning":"系，打结","explanation":"묶다：系，打结；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"묶다","audio":"/audio/8c1c77b95daf8436ba98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64741","senseId":"8","lemma":"묶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"991291daac49a3be","term":"꽉","zh":"紧紧，用力","audio":"/audio/991291daac49a3be8f11.mp3","entryId":"14647","definition":"尽全力的样子。","pronunciation":["꽉"]},{"id":"8c1c77b95daf8436","term":"묶다","zh":"系，打结","audio":"/audio/8c1c77b95daf8436ba98.mp3","entryId":"64741","definition":"用带子或绳子等打成结。","pronunciation":["묵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b8ad2db344e92eb9c72c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.498,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40430","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那要再绑紧一点吗？","我适合做什么工作呢？","这个结有点松，好像以后会散开的。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那要再绑紧一点吗？","这个结有点松，好像以后会散开的。","我适合做什么工作呢？"],"answer":0}]}
